@ Index:   Problem 4, 480 months, PMT then rate
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ 480 months, rate 0, PV 100000, FV 0. Solves PMT, then I%/a.
LBL ‘P4’
  480
  STO ‘NPPER’
  0
  STO ‘I%/a’
  100000
  STO ‘PV’
  0
  STO ‘PMT’
  STO ‘FV’
  12
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  ENDP
  PMT
  I/a
  END
